      { label: 'c', sublabel: 'ii', marks: 1, type: 'short', question: 'Explain the difference in electrical conductivity between liquid strontium chloride and liquid sulphur chloride.', keywords: [['SrCl2 has mobile ions','SrCl2 is ionic','strontium chloride conducts as it has ions'],['SCl2 has no ions','SCl2 is covalent','sulphur chloride has molecules only','no charged particles']], anyOf: 1 }
