      { label: 'c', sublabel: 'ii', marks: 1, type: 'short', question: 'The best way of disposing of plastic waste is recycling. What is another advantage of recycling plastics made from petroleum?', keywords: [['conserves petroleum','saves crude oil','preserves fossil fuels','saves non-renewable resources','petroleum is finite resource']], anyOf: 1 }
