        { label: 'e', marks: 2, type: 'long', question: 'When chlorine is bubbled through a colourless aqueous solution of zinc iodide, the solution turns brown. Name the brown substance. Suggest, using ideas about reactivity of the halogens, why this reaction occurs.', keywords: [['iodine'],['chlorine','more','reactive','than','iodine','displaces','iodine']], anyOf: 2 }
